{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfrpv5GzWougdddfW4Boa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"<REDACTED>","signature":""},{"type":"server_tool_use","id":"srvtoolu_01DVeWwPra28q4QnAfJi2gLR","name":"web_search","input":{"query":"Anthropic Claude Code official documentation overview"}},{"type":"web_search_tool_result","tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01DVeWwPra28q4QnAfJi2gLR","content":[{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code Official Documentation by Anthropic","url":"https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-docs/","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"412 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"GitHub - anthropics/claude-code: Claude Code is an agentic coding tool that lives in your terminal, understands your codebase, and helps you code faster by executing routine tasks, explaining complex code, and handling git workflows - all through natural language commands. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"6 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code overview docs: how to navigate, configure, and verify work","url":"https://www.eesel.ai/blog/claude-code-overview-docs","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"30 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"The Claude Code Handbook: A Professional Introduction to Building with AI-Assisted Development","url":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/claude-code-handbook/","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"197 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"GitHub - thevibeworks/claude-code-docs: Everything Anthropic ships for builders, archived and updated 4× daily. 3,900+ files. 12 sources. API, Claude Code, MCP, docs, cookbooks, skills, plugins.","url":"https://github.com/thevibeworks/claude-code-docs","encrypted_content":"","page_age":null},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"SDKs, CLI, and libraries - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/cli-sdks-libraries/overview","encrypted_content":"","page_age":null},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Overview - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/overview","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"86 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code by Anthropic","url":"https://claude.com/product/claude-code","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"7 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Documentation - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"69 days ago"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"Claude Code","url":"https://aiagentindex.mit.edu/2025/claude-code","encrypted_content":"","page_age":null}],"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"<REDACTED>","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I found the official overview. It's at **code.claude.com/docs/en/overview**.\n\n## Where the official docs are\nAnthropic's own GitHub repo for Claude Code links to "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"code.claude.com/docs/en/overview"},{"type":"text","text":". Some older third-party pages still give a different address, "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview"},{"type":"text","text":", but newer sources point to code.claude.com.\n\n## What the overview page says\n- **What it is:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Claude Code is an agentic coding tool that reads your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and integrates with your development tools."},{"type":"text","text":" It's "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"available in your terminal, IDE, desktop app, and browser."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **What it does:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"It helps you build features, fix bugs, and automate development tasks. It understands your entire codebase and can work across multiple files and tools to get things done."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **Access:** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Most surfaces require a Claude subscription or Anthropic Console account. The Terminal CLI, VS Code, and JetBrains also support third-party providers."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **Next steps:** The page links to a Quickstart that will "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"walk through your first real task, from exploring a codebase to committing a fix."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## Other official Anthropic resources\n- **Product page (claude.com/product/claude-code):** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Claude Code is included in Claude Pro and Max plans."},{"type":"text","text":" It's "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"available for macOS, Linux, and Windows."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"It runs locally in your terminal and talks directly to model APIs without requiring a backend server or remote code index. It also asks for permission before making changes to your files or running commands."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **GitHub repo (anthropics/claude-code):** "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"Use it in your terminal, IDE, or tag @claude on Github."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **Claude Platform docs:** These explain how Claude Code differs from the API tools. "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"The CLI, client SDKs, and libraries are for calling the Claude API yourself: you send each request and handle each response. Claude Code, the Claude Agent SDK, and Claude Managed Agents work at a higher level, providing the agent loop, tool execution, and runtime."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## Community resources (not from Anthropic)\n- **ClaudeLog:** This site "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"focuses on practical usage insights, optimization techniques, and community-driven best practices from real-world Claude Code usage."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **thevibeworks/claude-code-docs (GitHub):** An "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"auto-updating archive of Anthropic's builder documentation"},{"type":"text","text":", fetched 4 times a day. It says that "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"for official docs, visit code.claude.com and platform.claude.com."},{"type":"text","text":"\n- **eesel.ai guide:** Explains that "},{"citations":[],"type":"text","text":"the Claude Code overview explains the product and links into its setup, configuration, permissions, integrations, and troubleshooting documentation."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nFor setup or troubleshooting, start with the overview page and follow its links to the guide for your environment."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":3830,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2559},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":1,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null}